<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5078] It is not possible to cancel run all paragraphs operation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5078</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After &quot;run all&quot; is started, user must wait until all paragraphs are run as cancel buttons are disabled.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
